msgstr "A ya <strong>Tovuti ya bot</strong> Chakula cha bure (RSSkwa hisani ya RaiaMwema JSON Habari kutoka vyombo vya habari, YouTube Vituo vya redio, BlueskyKwa hivyo, MastodonKwa hivyo, Reddit, Substack na wengi zaidi: mtu yeyote anaweza kupendekeza moja, na mara moja kupitishwa ni ya tovuti, inayoendeshwa na admins na wanaohusishwa na mtu yeyote."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Circle guild is always private."
msgstr "Aina ya zabibu ni daima binafsi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Circle guild is private for good: only its members see it, and they post straight into it, so what they write does not appear on their own profiles. You invite members free, or set a price in coins to join, and the coins go to you. This can't be changed later."
msgstr "Chama cha Circle ni binafsi kwa ajili ya mema: wanachama wake tu kuona, na wao post moja kwa moja ndani yake, hivyo kile kuandika haionekani kwenye maelezo yao wenyewe. Unaalika wanachama huru, au kuweka bei katika sarafu kujiunga, na sarafu kwenda kwako. Hii haiwezi kubadilishwa baadaye."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Curation is your own named collection of guilds and accounts - like a custom feed, with an algorithm you choose. Keep it private just for yourself, or make it public so others can follow or fork it."
msgstr "Chakula kilichoandaliwa ni mkusanyiko wako wa majina ya vikundi na akaunti - kama kulisha desturi, na algorithm unayochagua. Fanya iwe ya kibinafsi kwako mwenyewe, au kuifanya iwe ya umma ili wengine waweze kuifuata au kuisimamisha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A QR code to sign in with. Scan it with your phone, where you are signed in."
msgstr "A ya QR Kanuni ya kuingia. Ingiza namba yako ya simu ambapo umejiandikisha."

