#, machine, plain2
msgid "Invite people to share this post. Once they accept it carries their name and is listed on their profile; on an anonymous post their credit is anonymous too. You still edit, delete and forward it."
msgstr "Wahimize watu kushiriki makala hii. Mara baada ya kukubali hubeba jina lao na limeorodheshwa kwenye wasifu wao; kwenye chapisho lisilojulikana mikopo yao haijulikani pia. Bado unabadilisha, kufuta na kuendeleza."

