msgstr "Jisajili kuwa msimamizi wa kikundi"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Invited On"
msgstr "Kuitwa kwenye"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It can't see your password, your posts or your settings, and you can sign it out at any time from the same page."
msgstr "Haiwezi kuona nenosiri lako, machapisho yako au mipangilio yako, na unaweza kuisaini wakati wowote kutoka ukurasa huo."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "It doesn't count towards your %(num)s bot."
msgid_plural "It doesn't count towards your %(num)s bots."
msgstr[0] "Sio tu juu ya bot yako."
msgstr[1] "Hii haina maana kwamba wewe ni juu ya %(num)s bots."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It ends by itself after this. You can end it sooner."
msgstr "Matokeo yake ni baada ya yenyewe. Unaweza kumaliza mapema zaidi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It is reviewed with the bot."
msgstr "Hii imefanywa na bot."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It leaves the site's pages. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented on it, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Inaacha kurasa za tovuti. Ikiwa ni chini ya dakika tano na hakuna mtu mwingine ambaye ametoa maoni juu yake, imefutwa: wewe tu na wasimamizi wa tovuti wanaweza kufungua nakala ya kibinafsi, kwa siku 90. Vinginevyo kile alisema anakaa katika Ingia kama Anonymous, bila jina na hakuna kiungo, na mtu yeyote anaweza kusoma huko."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It leaves your profile, feeds and guilds. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Inaacha wasifu wako, feeds na vikundi. Ikiwa ni chini ya dakika tano na hakuna mtu mwingine ambaye ametoa maoni, imefutwa: wewe tu na wasimamizi wa tovuti wanaweza kufungua nakala ya kibinafsi, kwa siku 90. Vinginevyo kile alisema anakaa katika Ingia kama Anonymous, bila jina na hakuna kiungo, na mtu yeyote anaweza kusoma huko."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It lives on your profile, under Spaces. A guild shows its card, with votes and shares, and opens the Space."
msgstr "Ni katika profile yako, chini ya nafasi. Chama kinaonyesha kadi yake, na kura na hisa, na kufungua nafasi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It only orders posts you are allowed to see."
msgstr "Ni tu amri posts wewe ni kuruhusiwa kuona."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It shows, in full, every word and phrase the word filter looks for, in every language it covers. That includes slurs and other extremely offensive language."
msgstr "Inaonyesha, kwa ukamilifu, kila neno na maneno filter neno inaonekana kwa, katika kila lugha inashughulikia. Hii ni pamoja na lugha ya matusi na lugha nyingine mbaya."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It stays a child account with the child lock, but you can no longer see it or change what it can do, and you can't link it again."
msgstr "Inabakia akaunti ya mtoto na kufuli mtoto, lakini huwezi kuona tena au kubadilisha nini inaweza kufanya, na huwezi kuunganisha tena."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It stays on the Child word filter, which hides profanity and anything marked sensitive. A child account only reads: it can't post or comment, but you can still vote, follow, join guilds, bookmark and report."
msgstr "Inakaa kwenye Neno la Mtoto filter, ambayo huficha uchafu na kitu chochote kilichoonekana nyeti. Akaunti ya mtoto inasoma tu: haiwezi kuchapisha au kutoa maoni, lakini bado unaweza kupiga kura, kufuata, kujiunga na vikundi, alama na ripoti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "It was not approved last time. The admins said: %(note)s"
msgstr "Haikukubaliwa kwa mara ya mwisho. Viongozi hao walisema %(note)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It will be able to:"
msgstr "Utakuwa na uwezo wa:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It will be read again within a few minutes."
msgstr "Itasomwa tena ndani ya dakika chache."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It will not be able to see your password or personal data, or change your account settings."
msgstr "Hutaweza kuona nywila yako au data ya kibinafsi, au kubadilisha mipangilio ya akaunti yako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It will see your chats, groups and channels and can send messages as you."
msgstr "Unaweza kuona barua pepe yako, barua pepe, na anwani yako."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "It works through your app <strong>%(app)s</strong> (client id <code>%(client)s</code>)."
msgstr "Inafanya kazi kupitia App yako <strong>%(app)s</strong> (Sauti ya IMM) <code>%(client)s</code>)."

