msgstr "Hii inaitwa %(name)s sasa."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It's too late to refuse this code: it has run out or has been used. If you don't recognise a sign-in, log out everywhere, and check your apps too."
msgstr "Ni kuchelewa sana kukataa kanuni hii: imekuwa kukimbia nje au imekuwa kutumika. Kama huna kutambua kuingia, kuunganisha kila mahali, na kuangalia programu yako pia."

