#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The link can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The link can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Kiungo kinaweza kuwa katika tabia zaidi ya %(num)s."
msgstr[1] "Kiungo kinaweza kuwa katika wahusika zaidi ya %(num)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Kiungo hakiwezi kuwa na jina la mtumiaji au nenosiri."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Kiungo hakiwezi kuwa na nafasi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Kiungo lazima kuanza na https:// au http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The link needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Kiungo kinahitaji anwani kamili, kama mfano.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list is open to members so that anyone can see what the filter hides and why. Nothing on it is removed from the site: each member's own filter decides what they see."
msgstr "Orodha ni wazi kwa wanachama ili mtu yeyote anaweza kuona nini filter kujificha na kwa nini. Hakuna kitu juu yake ni kuondolewa kutoka tovuti: kila mwanachama mwenyewe filter kuamua nini wanaona."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The list isn't shown on the Child filter"
msgstr "Orodha haionekani kwenye filter ya mtoto"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coin every 30 days."
msgid_plural "The most a circle can ask is %(num)s coins every 30 days."
msgstr[0] "Zaidi ya mzunguko unaweza kuuliza ni sarafu %(num)s kila siku 30."
msgstr[1] "Zaidi ya mzunguko unaweza kuuliza ni sarafu %(num)s kila siku 30."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The most voted posts of the last seven days."
msgstr "Idadi ya kura zilizopigwa katika kipindi cha siku saba zilizopita."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The name %(host)s could not be found."
msgstr "Majina ya %(host)s Haikuweza kupatikana."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The newest of what they have done. Only the names of who they chat with are shown, never what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr "Kazi mpya wanayoifanya. Tu majina ya ambao wao kuzungumza na ni kuonyeshwa, kamwe nini chat anasema: chat ni mwisho-kwa-mwisho encrypted."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of an anonymous author"
msgstr "Idadi ya waandishi wasiojulikana"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The number of items you confirmed doesn't match what was chosen. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Idadi ya vitu vilivyothibitishwa hailingani na kile kilichochaguliwa. Hakuna kilichobadilika."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The numbers are always shown on your profile. This decides who can open each list and see the accounts on it. An account is only listed where its own setting allows it too."
msgstr "Aina hii daima inaonekana katika profile yako. Hii ina maana kwamba mtu yeyote anaweza kufungua akaunti na kufungua akaunti. Akaunti imeorodheshwa tu ambapo mipangilio yake inaruhusu pia."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The open-source platform for independent internet communities"
msgstr "Jukwaa la chanzo wazi kwa jumuiya za mtandao wa kujitegemea"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The original content is not retained anywhere, including in this history."
msgstr "Maudhui ya awali hayahifadhiwa popote, ikiwa ni pamoja na katika historia hii."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The other authors of a shared draft removed you as an author. What you wrote stays credited to you."
msgstr "Waandishi wengine wa rasimu ya pamoja walikuondoa kama mwandishi. Kile unachoandika kinaaminiwa kwako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner deletes a channel instead of leaving it."
msgstr "Mmiliki hufungua kituo badala ya kuondoka."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The owner's role can't be changed."
msgstr "Wajibu wa mmiliki hauwezi kubadilishwa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The page's current text isn't shown here; what you save replaces it."
msgstr "Nakala ya ukurasa wa sasa haionyeshwa hapa; kile unachohifadhi kinabadilisha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture could not be stored. Try again later."
msgstr "Picha haiwezi kuhifadhiwa. Jaribu tena baadaye."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture goes to your own linked storage, not to this site. You can add a few words under it."
msgstr "Picha inakwenda kwenye hifadhi yako iliyounganishwa, sio kwenye tovuti hii. Unaweza kuongeza maneno machache chini yake."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The picture you chose"
msgstr "Picha ambayo umechagua"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post appears on the profile of whoever publishes it first. Optionally forward it into guilds for community discussion: each guild gets its own independent copy with its own votes and comments. Guilds are forwarded to when the draft is first published."
msgstr "Makala inaonekana kwenye wasifu wa mtu yeyote anayechapisha kwanza. Chaguo mbele yake katika vikundi kwa majadiliano ya jamii: kila kikundi hupata nakala yake ya kujitegemea na kura zake na maoni. Wajumbe wa kamati hiyo watajulishwa wakati rasimu hiyo itakapochapishwa kwanza."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post carries your name and is listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your name."
msgstr "Makala hii hubeba jina lako na imeorodheshwa kwenye wasifu wako. Kura, maoni na mbele hushirikiwa na mwandishi wake, ambaye huhariri na kufuta. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote: chapisho linakaa, bila jina lako."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post is not listed on your profile. Votes, comments and forwards are shared with its author, who edits and deletes it. You can step off at any time: the post stays, without your credit."
msgstr "Makala hii si waliotajwa katika profile yako. Kura, maoni na mbele hushirikiwa na mwandishi wake, ambaye huhariri na kufuta. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote: chapisho linakaa, bila mkopo wako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The post refused the change."
msgstr "Kamati hiyo ilikataa mabadiliko hayo."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post stays where it is, with your name taken off it, and leaves your profile. Its Rep leaves you too. Everyone who saw it with your name still knows it was you."
msgstr "Makala anakaa ambapo ni, na jina lako kuchukuliwa mbali, na majani profile yako. Utii wake pia unakufanya uwe Kila mtu ambaye ameona jina lake bado anajua ni wewe."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author"
msgstr "Mwandishi wa post"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The post's author deleted it, so it is shown as Anonymous: no name and no link. The comments under it stay as they were; one its author deleted is shown as Anonymous too."
msgstr "Mwandishi wa chapisho alifuta, kwa hivyo imeonyeshwa kama Anonymous: hakuna jina na hakuna kiungo. Maoni yaliyo chini yake hukaa kama ilivyokuwa; mwandishi wake mmoja aliyefutwa anaonyeshwa kama Anonymous pia."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The promo code `%(code)s` is not currently valid. Please begin a new transaction."
msgstr "Kanuni ya promo `%(code)s` Kwa sasa si halali. Tafadhali anza biashara mpya."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The proposal for @%(name)s has been withdrawn."
msgstr "Mapendekezo ya @%(name)s imeondolewa."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was deleted."
msgstr "Jukumu la %(role)s Iliondolewa."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was made."
msgstr "Jukumu la %(role)s iliandaliwa."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The role %(role)s was saved."
msgstr "Jukumu la %(role)s Alikuwa ameokolewa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The royal bank has told us that you owe them some coin. You'll need to pay off your debts before you can continue."
msgstr "Benki ya kifalme imetuambia kuwa una deni la fedha. Utahitaji kulipa madeni yako kabla ya kuendelea."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules"
msgstr "Kanuni za"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules below"
msgstr "Kanuni hizi hapa chini"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The rules can be at most %(count)s character."
msgid_plural "The rules can be at most %(count)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Sheria inaweza kuwa zaidi ya %(count)s wa tabia."
msgstr[1] "Sheria inaweza kuwa zaidi ya %(count)s wahusika."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The rules can't contain control or invisible characters."
msgstr "Sheria haiwezi kuwa na wahusika wa kudhibiti au wasioonekana."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The screenshot you are sending"
msgstr "Picha ya skrini unayotuma"

#. %(status)s is an HTTP status code
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answered %(status)s."
msgstr "Mtumiaji akajibu %(status)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The server answers with the posts to show and their order; %(site)s still hides anything a viewer may not see, and tells the server nothing about who is looking. Everyone is told that an outside server ranks this curation."
msgstr "Server majibu na posts kuonyesha na utaratibu wao; %(site)s bado kujificha chochote mtazamaji hawezi kuona, na anaelezea server kitu chochote kuhusu nani ni kuangalia. Kila mtu anaambiwa kwamba seva ya nje inashikilia chakula hiki kilichopangwa."

#, python-format
msgid "The server named %(num)s post; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgid_plural "The server named %(num)s posts; you can see %(seen)s of them."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The server thinks you're asking something silly. It might take you more seriously if you take off the jester outfit."
msgstr "Mwandishi anasema kuwa wewe ni kuuliza swali la kijinga. Inaweza kuchukua wewe umakini zaidi kama wewe kuchukua mbali outfit jester."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site refused the bot's session."
msgstr "Tovuti ilikataa kikao cha bot."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins have it already."
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa tovuti hii tayari wana."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The site's admins marked this guild sensitive, so only an admin can change this."
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa tovuti alama hii chama nyeti, hivyo tu admin anaweza kubadilisha hii."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "The site's admins will read it. They are never told who reported."
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa tovuti wataisoma. Haijafahamika ni nani aliyeripoti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The stage is full (%(num)s person)."
msgid_plural "The stage is full (%(num)s people)."
msgstr[0] "Hatua ni kamili (%(num)s watu)."
msgstr[1] "Idadi ya watu ni (%(num)s watu)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The storage service is not answering right now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Huduma ya mwenyeji wa wavuti haijibu sasa. Jaribu tena kwa wakati mmoja."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The summary can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The summary can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Muhtasari unaweza kuwa zaidi ya tabia moja."
msgstr[1] "Orodha inaweza kuwa zaidi ya wahusika wa %(num)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The summary can be changed while the Space is live."
msgstr "Muhtasari unaweza kubadilishwa wakati nafasi ni hai."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text isn't shown: this was removed by the site's administrators."
msgstr "Nakala haijaonyeshwa: hii iliondolewa na watendaji wa tovuti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The text of this version was hidden by a site administrator."
msgstr "Nakala ya toleo hili ilifichwa na msimamizi wa tovuti."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time before links must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Muda kabla ya viungo lazima iwe idadi ya siku, 0 kwa %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The time in the guild must be a whole number of days, 0 to %(max)s."
msgstr "Muda katika chama lazima iwe idadi ya siku, 0 kwa %(max)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The title can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The title can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Jina lake linaweza kuwa zaidi ya jina moja."
msgstr[1] "Kichwa inaweza kuwa katika wahusika zaidi ya %(num)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The two revisions have the same text."
msgstr "Tafsiri zote mbili zina maandishi sawa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your Google Drive. Try again."
msgstr "Kuingia kwenye akaunti yako hakupatikani Google DriveJaribu tena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive in your OneDrive. Try again."
msgstr "Kuingia kwenye akaunti yako hakupatikani OneDriveJaribu tena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The upload did not arrive. Try again."
msgstr "Uendelezaji haukufikia. Jaribu tena."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The username @%(name)s has been pre-emptively reserved for: %(who)s"
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji @%(name)s Imehifadhiwa kabla ya: %(who)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The usual order - everything from the guilds and accounts you add"
msgstr "Amri ya kawaida - kila kitu kutoka kwa vikundi na akaunti unazoongeza"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading to Dailymotion. Add it again."
msgstr "Video hiyo haikuishia hapo DailymotionOngeza tena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The video did not finish uploading. Add it again."
msgstr "Video hiyo haikuishia hapo. Ongeza tena."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The website can be at most %(num)s character."
msgid_plural "The website can be at most %(num)s characters."
msgstr[0] "Tovuti inaweza kuwa na sifa zaidi ya moja."
msgstr[1] "Tovuti inaweza kuwa na wahusika zaidi ya %(num)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain a user name or password."
msgstr "Tovuti haiwezi kuwa na jina la mtumiaji au nenosiri."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website can't contain spaces."
msgstr "Tovuti haiwezi kuwa na nafasi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website must start with https:// or http://."
msgstr "Tovuti inapaswa kuanza na https:// au http://."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The website needs a full address, such as example.com."
msgstr "Tovuti inahitaji anwani kamili, kama mfano.com."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The whole site <span class=\"text-muted\">(needs an age limit of a month or less)</span>"
msgstr "Tovuti nzima <span class=\"text-muted\">(Unahitaji umri wa mwezi mmoja au chini)</span>"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki is off: only guildmasters see it."
msgstr "Wiki iko mbali: Wasimamizi wa kikundi tu wanaiona."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The wiki's first page can be emptied but not deleted."
msgstr "Ukurasa wa kwanza wa wiki unaweza kufunguliwa lakini haukufutwa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The word filter has no words at the moment."
msgstr "Neno filter halina maneno kwa sasa."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The words for other languages are adapted from %(source)s (%(licence)s): words that are also ordinary, innocent words were left out."
msgstr "Maneno kwa lugha nyingine hutafsiriwa kutoka %(source)s (i) (i)%(licence)sManeno ambayo pia ni maneno ya kawaida na yasiyo na hatia yaliachwa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "The working copy as it is now. Only its authors can see this until it's published."
msgstr "Nakala ya kazi kama ilivyo sasa. Waandishi wa habari wanaweza kuona hii mpaka ichapishwe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Theater"
msgstr "Theatre ya Theater"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Historia yao ya maoni itaonyeshwa hapa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their forwarding activity will show here."
msgstr "Kazi yao ya kuhubiri itaonyeshwa hapa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posting history will show here."
msgstr "Historia yake ya soka itaonyeshwa hapa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Their posts and comments are left out of your feeds and threads and they cannot notify you. They are not told, and they can still follow you, comment on your posts and message you. Their anonymous posts and comments are not hidden, as hiding only those would tell you who wrote them. Mute someone from the menu on any of their posts or comments, or from their profile."
msgstr "Machapisho yao na maoni yanaachwa nje ya feeds yako na nyuzi na hawawezi kukuarifu. Wao si aliiambia, na wanaweza bado kufuata, maoni juu ya posts yako na ujumbe. Machapisho yao yasiyojulikana na maoni hayafichikani, kwa kuwaficha wale tu watakuambia ni nani aliyeandika. Mute mtu kutoka kwenye menyu kwenye machapisho yoyote au maoni yao, au kutoka kwenye wasifu wao."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no approved users"
msgstr "Hakuna watumiaji walioidhinishwa"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no exiled users"
msgstr "Hakuna watumiaji waliosajiliwa"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmaster invitations."
msgstr "Hakuna maombi ya moderator."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no guildmasters."
msgstr "Hakuna kikomo cha msimamizi."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There are no posts here."
msgstr "Hakuna matangazo hapa."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "There is no account named @%(name)s."
msgstr "Hakuna akaunti inayoitwa @%(name)s."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing here to appeal."
msgstr "Hakuna chochote hapa cha kuomba."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is nothing to save yet."
msgstr "Hakuna chochote cha kuokoa hadi sasa."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There is nothing waiting for this ban."
msgstr "Hakuna chochote kinachosubiri marufuku hiyo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There was a problem. Please try again."
msgstr "Kulikuwa na tatizo. Tafadhali jaribu tena."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no names in that file."
msgstr "Hakukuwa na majina katika ripoti hiyo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There were no survivors."
msgstr "Hakukuwa na manusura."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's a shortage of perfect request entities in this world. Would be a pity to damage yours."
msgstr "Kuna upungufu wa mashirika ya maombi kamili katika ulimwengu huu. Itakuwa ni aibu kwa ajili ya kupoteza yako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's already an open proposal like this one."
msgstr "Tayari kuna pendekezo la wazi kama hili."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no account with that name."
msgstr "Hakuna akaunti kwa jina hilo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's no invitation to speak."
msgstr "Hakuna haja ya kuzungumza."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "There's no recovery code to keep yet."
msgstr "Hakuna kodi ya mapato ambayo bado inahitajika."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing here right now."
msgstr "Hakuna kitu hapa kwa sasa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There's nothing left here but a giant smouldering crater."
msgstr "Hakuna kitu kilichoachwa hapa, lakini kuna harufu kubwa ya harufu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These are the users you are subscribed to."
msgstr "Hawa ni watumiaji ambao umejiandikisha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These counts start from the day guild insights were switched on: before that the site did not record when people left a guild or how often its page was opened."
msgstr "Makosa haya huanza kutoka kwa ufahamu wa kikundi cha siku yalibadilishwa: kabla ya kuwa tovuti hiyo haikurekodi wakati watu waliacha kikundi au mara ngapi ukurasa wake ulifunguliwa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These filters are saved as your default"
msgstr "Filters hizi zinahifadhiwa kama default yako"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These topics"
msgstr "Mada hizi"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These users have been invited to moderate +%(guild)s."
msgstr "Watumiaji hawa wamealikwa kwa wastani +%(guild)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They already have this role."
msgstr "Tayari wana jukumu hilo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are 18 or over, so they can make their own account."
msgstr "Wana umri wa miaka 18 au zaidi, hivyo wanaweza kufanya akaunti zao wenyewe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are already in this circle."
msgstr "Tayari wapo kwenye kundi hili."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They are not told. Anyone you block leaves your circles."
msgstr "Hawakuambiwa. Mtu yeyote ambaye anazuia majani yako."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They are signed out everywhere, chat apps included. If they use chat, they may need their recovery code, or a browser where they've used chat, to read their old messages."
msgstr "Wao ni kuunganishwa kila mahali, chat programu ni pamoja na. Kama wao kutumia chat, wanaweza haja yao ahueni code, au browser ambapo wameweza kutumika chat, kusoma ujumbe wao wa zamani."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "They aren't in %(circle)s."
msgstr "Hawakuwa katika %(circle)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't in this group."
msgstr "Hawapo kwenye kundi hili."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They aren't muted here."
msgstr "Hawana aibu hapa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can buy and spend coins, tip, buy Premium and join or run paid circles."
msgstr "Unaweza kununua na kutumia sarafu, ncha, kununua Premium kujiunga au kujiunga na vyama vya ushirika."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They can join and listen to Spaces. They can't host one or post in one: a child account only reads. Voice calls in a Space also need Chat to be on."
msgstr "Wanaweza kushiriki na kusikiliza sauti za watu. Haiwezi kuhudhuria moja au chapisho katika moja: akaunti ya mtoto inasoma tu. Sauti wito katika nafasi pia haja ya kuzungumza."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can message people, join group chats and make calls. The site never shows you what a chat says: chats are end-to-end encrypted. Whoever knows their password can still sign in and read them."
msgstr "Wanaweza kutuma ujumbe kwa watu, kujiunga na mazungumzo ya kikundi na kufanya simu. Tovuti kamwe inaonyesha nini chat anasema: mazungumzo ni mwisho-kwa-mwisho encrypted. Mtu yeyote ambaye anajua jina lake anaweza kuingia na kusoma."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can see what you do on the site: your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported, and your recent sign-ins. The site never shows them what your chats say, because chats are end-to-end encrypted. But anyone who knows your password, a parent who chose it included, can sign in as you: change it in Security so that only you know it. They choose which of these are on for your account:"
msgstr "Wanaweza kuona kile unachofanya kwenye tovuti: machapisho yako, maoni, kura, alama, ifuatavyo, vikundi, ambao unawasiliana nao, kwamba akaunti yako iliripotiwa, na saini zako za hivi karibuni. Tovuti kamwe inaonyesha yao nini chats yako kusema, kwa sababu mazungumzo ni mwisho-kwa-mwisho encrypted. Lakini mtu yeyote ambaye anajua nywila yako, mzazi aliyechagua ni pamoja na, anaweza kuingia kama wewe: kubadilisha katika usalama ili tu wewe kujua. Ni nani kati yao atakayechagua kutoka kwako"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They can start a guild. They still can't post or comment: a child account only reads."
msgstr "Wanaweza kuanzisha kikundi. Bado hawawezi kuandika au kutoa maoni: Akaunti ya mtoto inasoma tu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They can't comment on your posts or comments, chat with you or notify you by mentioning you. They are not told, but they may work it out if they try to comment on something of yours."
msgstr "Hawawezi kutoa maoni juu ya machapisho yako au maoni, kuzungumza na wewe au kukujulisha kwa kukutaja. Hawaambiwi, lakini wanaweza kufanya kazi nje ikiwa wanajaribu kutoa maoni juu ya kitu chako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They don't have this role."
msgstr "Hawana jukumu hili."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They go straight to your coin balance."
msgstr "Nenda moja kwa moja kwenye akaunti yako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They haven't asked for that."
msgstr "Hawakuwa wanauliza hivyo."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "They leave the site. What they said stays in the Log as Anonymous, except for anything made in the last five minutes that nobody has commented on, which is erased. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Wanaondoka kwenye tovuti. Kile walichokuwa wanasema kinakaa kwenye Ingia kama Anonymous, isipokuwa kwa kitu chochote kilichofanywa katika dakika tano zilizopita ambacho hakuna mtu aliyezungumzia, ambacho kimefutwa. Hii haiwezi kupuuzwa."

#, machine, plain1
