msgstr "Simu yako inakubali hali hiyo. Endelea kama hii ni akaunti yako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your phone said no, so nobody was signed in."
msgstr "Simu yako ilisema hapana, kwa hivyo hakuna mtu aliyesajiliwa."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your post"
msgstr "Makala yako"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your post is listed on your profile either way. Choose My profile to have its comments there too, and add guilds to post it straight into them: each guild gets its own copy with its own votes and comments."
msgstr "Makala yako ni waliotajwa katika profile yako kwa njia yoyote. Chagua kuchagua Wasifu wangu kuwa na maoni yake huko pia, na kuongeza vikundi ili kuichapisha moja kwa moja ndani yao: kila kikundi hupata nakala yake mwenyewe na kura zake na maoni."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posting history will show here."
msgstr "Historia yako ya kuchapisha itaonyeshwa hapa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts are kept out of All."
msgstr "Machapisho yako yanahifadhiwa kwa kila kitu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts can appear in All."
msgstr "Makala yako inaweza kuonekana katika kila kitu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts from the last 28 days, with what each got (a post and its guild forwards added up). Only you can see this; these are counts, never names."
msgstr "Machapisho yako kutoka siku za mwisho za 28, na kile ambacho kila mmoja alipata (chapisho na washirika wake wa kikundi aliongeza). Ni wewe tu unayeweza kuona haya; haya ni makosa, si majina."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your posts stay on your profile and in the feeds of people who follow you, but All leaves them out. Copies you forward to a guild follow that guild's own setting, and anonymous posts always appear in All, so nobody can tell which ones are yours."
msgstr "Machapisho yako hukaa kwenye wasifu wako na katika malisho ya watu wanaokufuata, lakini yote yanawaacha nje. Inakuweka mbele kwa kikundi kufuata mpangilio wa kikundi hicho mwenyewe, na machapisho yasiyojulikana daima yanaonekana katika All, kwa hivyo hakuna mtu anayeweza kusema ni yako."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile"
msgstr "Wasifu wako"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your profile details have been updated."
msgstr "Maelezo yako ya wasifu yamesasishwa."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your purchase was successful. A receipt will be emailed to you from Paypal."
msgstr "Biashara yako ilikuwa na mafanikio. Utapokea barua pepe kutoka PayPal."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your roles"
msgstr "Majukumu yako"

#. a notification. %(title)s is the post's title; %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"%(title)s\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr "Makala yako ya »%(title)s\"Haiwezi kuchapishwa: %(reason)sNi kuokolewa katika rasimu yako, hivyo unaweza kurekebisha na kuichapisha au ratiba yake tena."

#. a notification about a post with no title. %(reason)s says why, as a
#. sentence starting in lowercase.
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid ""
"Your scheduled post \"Untitled\" could not be published: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"It is saved in your drafts, so you can fix it and post it or schedule it again."
msgstr ""
"Makala yako iliyopangwa \"Untitled\" haikuweza kuchapishwa: %(reason)s\n"
"\n"
"Ni kuokolewa katika rasimu yako, hivyo unaweza kurekebisha na kuichapisha au ratiba yake tena."

