#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your subscriptions"
msgstr "Michango yako"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your suspension has ended. You can use %(site)s as you did before."
msgstr "Kuacha kwako kumeisha. Unaweza kutumia %(site)s kama walivyofanya hapo awali."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your suspension has ended. Your account is still on hold, so it can't post, comment or vote until a member of the staff has looked at it."
msgstr "Kuacha kwako kumeisha. Akaunti yako bado inashikilia, kwa hivyo haiwezi kuchapisha, kutoa maoni au kupiga kura mpaka mwanachama wa wafanyakazi ameiangalia."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your title is the question. %(min)s to %(max)s options, one vote each. The poll can be voted from every forward and repost of this post."
msgstr "Kichwa chako ni swali. %(min)s Kwa kuwa %(max)s Uchaguzi, kura moja kwa kila mmoja. Uchaguzi unaweza kupiga kura kutoka kwa kila mbele na kurudiwa kwa chapisho hili."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your title is the question. Give %(min)s to %(max)s options. People can vote from every forward and repost of this post, once each."
msgstr "Kichwa chako ni swali. Kutoa %(min)s Kwa kuwa %(max)s chaguzi. Watu wanaweza kupiga kura kutoka kila mbele na kurudi nyuma ya chapisho hili, mara moja kila mmoja."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your two-factor code"
msgstr "Kanuni yako ya msingi"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your username is your unique <code>@handle</code>: the address of your profile, and what people mention and search for. Changing it costs 20 Coins and may be done once every 7 days. To change how your name reads without that, use your display name above."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji ni yako ya kipekee <code>@handle</code>anwani ya profile yako, na nini watu kutaja na kutafuta. Kubadilisha ni gharama 20 sarafu na inaweza kufanyika mara moja kila siku 7. Ili kubadilisha jinsi jina lako linavyosoma bila hiyo, tumia jina lako la kuonyesha hapo juu."

#, machine, plain1
